# A "for as long as" duration that tracks a permanent ends when it phases out, because it can no longer see it (CR 702.26f;
# Teferi's Protection's ruling on Mathas, Fiend Seeker). Eluge's enters trigger puts a flood counter on Bot1's Plains, which is
# an Island too "for as long as it has a flood counter on it". Teferi's Protection phases the Plains out: as it phases in on
# turn 5 it keeps the flood counter (CR 702.26d) but is no Island any more.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Eluge, the Shoreless Sea
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Teferi's Protection
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

